From 542c90ac00ec1d6b0808a04683c1aca4ab3fc64d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 11:51:30 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 07/18] Add a feature-gated phase timing hook and breakdown
 example

Prepared::profile_json, behind the new profiling feature, times one
JSON call's decode, evaluation and encode phases. examples/breakdown.rs
uses it, together with the typed matrix call, to report median phase
times for the benchmark workloads. Default builds and the library's
behavior are unchanged; this is measurement tooling, not a round.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
